["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, July to August, August to September and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 32 of those years. In 2025, August to September on the middle came in at 56% of normal. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, and grids 21800 and 22102 fell to 72% of normal in 1988.</p>"}
